+### Web UI
+
+Tenant pages are Livewire components under `App\Livewire\Entity`, rendered with
+Bulma and translated through `lang/{locale}/ui.php`. Manager pages
+(`entity.members`, `entity.queues`) authorize at mount and inside every action;
+the attendant page (`entity.serve`) is open to any member but only lists and
+calls queues allowed by `QueuePolicy::call`. The components never reimplement
+domain rules: they call `CreateQueue`, `UpdateQueue`, `SetQueueAccess` and
+`CallNextTicket`, then surface domain exceptions as notices or field errors.
+
+All ids arriving from the browser are untrusted. Queue and membership lookups
+are always scoped through the current entity before use, so tampered or foreign
+ids raise not-found errors and mutate nothing.
+
